{
 "duration": 23.214,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Emma went for a quick solo hike and told no one.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.059
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she took a wrong fork, and her phone lost signal.",
   "start": 3.309,
   "end": 6.168
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody knew where to start looking.",
   "start": 6.418,
   "end": 7.951
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 8.301,
   "end": 9.228
  },
  {
   "text": "Before every hike, text one person your trail, your parking spot, and the time you'll be back.",
   "start": 9.528,
   "end": 14.778
  },
  {
   "text": "Tell them who to call if you're late.",
   "start": 15.028,
   "end": 16.659
  },
  {
   "text": "Then check in when you're out.",
   "start": 16.859,
   "end": 18.14
  },
  {
   "text": "Emma never skips that text now.",
   "start": 18.54,
   "end": 20.342
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this and send it to your hiking friend.",
   "start": 20.742,
   "end": 23.014
  }
 ],
